---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Work | Bryce Mason">
  <section class="page">
    <section class="page-head">
      <p class="mini-label">Work</p>
      <h1>Experience across finance, strategy, research, and leadership.</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        My background includes experience across finance, strategy, research,
        and leadership. I am especially interested in work that combines
        analytical thinking, practical problem solving, and exposure to
        emerging industries.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Relevant Experience</h2>

      <article class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>G3 Enterprises</h3>
            <p class="meta">Finance / Sales Operations Intern</p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://www.g3enterprises.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="logo-link"
            aria-label="Visit G3 Enterprises website"
          >
            <span class="logo-circle">
              <img src="/g3.png" alt="G3 Enterprises logo" class="job-logo" />
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>
          At G3 Enterprises, I worked on reporting, analytics, and operational
          projects connected to sales performance and strategic decision-making.
          I built dashboards and reports to track trends across sales and
          customer data, supported broader business analysis by identifying
          patterns that could inform decisions, and led an Enterprise Risk
          Management project focused on financial and operational risks. I also
          improved CRM data integrity by cleaning and standardizing Salesforce
          records, expanding contacts, and generating new leads, and I explored
          ways to use AI and automation to strengthen business intelligence and
          support sales teams more effectively.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>Perca</h3>
            <p class="meta">Finance &amp; Strategy Projects</p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://perca.net/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="logo-link"
            aria-label="Visit Perca website"
          >
            <span class="logo-circle">
              <img src="/perca.jpg" alt="Perca logo" class="job-logo" />
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>
          My work with Perca has focused on finance, operations, and feasibility
          analysis related to environmental infrastructure. I supported
          financial evaluation tied to a capital-intensive wastewater treatment
          system and built out models using cost assumptions, revenue scenarios,
          and sensitivity analysis to better understand scalability, economics,
          and capital efficiency.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>Unsal Partners</h3>
            <p class="meta">M&amp;A Research Intern</p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/unsal-partners/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="logo-link"
            aria-label="Visit Unsal Partners page"
          >
            <span class="logo-circle">
              <img src="/Unsal.png" alt="Unsal Partners logo" class="job-logo" />
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>
          At Unsal Partners, I conducted research on energy services companies
          and supported acquisition screening through structured analysis. I
          built and maintained a target database with detailed information on
          ownership, market position, technical capabilities, and acquisition
          fit, and I helped design an AI-assisted workflow that made the
          research process faster and more scalable while still requiring
          careful review for quality and usefulness.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>Whitman Investment Banking Competition</h3>
            <p class="meta">Student Participant</p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/whitman-wic/posts/?feedView=all"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="logo-link"
            aria-label="Visit Whitman Investment Company page"
          >
            <span class="logo-circle">
              <img src="/WIC.jpg" alt="Whitman Investment Company logo" class="job-logo" />
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>
          Through Whitman’s investment banking competition, I gained applied
          exposure to valuation, M&amp;A thinking, and finance-oriented teamwork.
          The experience strengthened my comfort with analyzing companies,
          building structured recommendations, and presenting ideas in a more
          formal and competitive setting.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>Finance Accelerator Program</h3>
            <p class="meta">Group Leader</p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/whitman-wic/posts/?feedView=all"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="logo-link"
            aria-label="Visit Whitman Investment Company page"
          >
            <span class="logo-circle">
              <img src="/WIC.jpg" alt="Whitman Investment Company logo" class="job-logo" />
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <p>
          In the Finance Accelerator Program, I led a student consulting team
          working with West Monroe Partners to design a generative AI strategy
          and present a proof-of-concept roadmap. The program gave me exposure
          to business analysis, client-facing communication, and the process of
          turning a broad idea into a more concrete strategic recommendation.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Leadership &amp; Additional Experience</h2>

      <article class="job compact">
        <div class="job-header no-logo">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>Whitman Alpine Ski Team</h3>
            <p class="meta">President / Captain</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          I help lead the team through coordination, organization, and
          communication responsibilities, while also supporting team culture,
          logistics, and broader operations.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job compact">
        <div class="job-header no-logo">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>Phi Delta Theta</h3>
            <p class="meta">Vice President</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          In this role, I help oversee chapter operations and take on broader
          responsibility across planning, accountability, and member
          coordination.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job compact">
        <div class="job-header no-logo">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>Marine Mammal Center</h3>
            <p class="meta">Ocean Conservation Leader Intern</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          This role gave me experience supporting conservation-focused work and
          public engagement tied to environmental awareness and stewardship.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="job compact">
        <div class="job-header no-logo">
          <div class="job-title-group">
            <h3>One Tam</h3>
            <p class="meta">LINC Intern</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          At One Tam, I worked in a role centered on community connection,
          support, and engagement with the natural environment.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 0 60px;
  }

  .page-head {
    margin-bottom: 34px;
  }

  .mini-label {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #a9c2af;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: #c8cfcc;
    font-size: 1.06rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .section + .section {
    margin-top: 52px;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .job {
    background: #1c1f22;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e33;
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 26px 28px;
  }

  .job + .job {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .job-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .job-header.no-logo {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .job-title-group {
    min-width: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .meta {
    color: #a9c2af;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.96rem;
  }

  .logo-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .logo-circle {
    width: 76px;
    height: 76px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #f3f5f2;
    border: 1px solid #dfe5df;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
  }

  .logo-link:hover .logo-circle {
    transform: scale(1.04);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(84, 122, 94, 0.18);
  }

  .job-logo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .job p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.82;
    color: #c8cfcc;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .page {
      padding-bottom: 50px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
    }

    .job {
      padding: 22px 20px;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .job-header {
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .logo-circle {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      padding: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>